					"usage_notes": "Tentacle Grapple (26): The tentacles are not very strong, but the squid has many of them. Wrestling at DX+1 gives the squid a ST score of 13 for the purpose of grappling. The squid has Constriction Attack. Effective skill 26 includes a +14 bonus for using 8 tentacles at once. Reach C-2."
				},
